# Secrets — the agent must not read these
.env
.env.*
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*

# Local data stores
*.db

# Build artifacts and noise
node_modules/
coverage/
dist/

# Control surface — committed, versioned, and not the agent's to read or edit.
#
# The mode file and the rulebook are what govern the agent; they are already
# loaded into its instructions, so it has no reason to open them and every
# reason not to change them. Leaving them visible let a rulebook edit ride
# along in a code branch, where rule 06 correctly blocked the pull request -
# the right outcome reached the expensive way.
#
# They stay in git. They simply stop being files in the agent's working set.
.bob/custom_modes.yaml
.bob/rules/
.bob/skills/
.bobignore
